<section class="index-surface shadow-box reading-surface">
  <div class="reading-heading">
    <div><span class="reading-eyebrow">SILUNE · YOUR READING SPACE</span><h2>故事未完，随时继续</h2><p>一本书，一段留给自己的时间。</p></div>
    <a class="fq-history-link" href="/fanqie/">番茄下载器 ↗</a>
  </div>
  <aside class="reading-storage-note"><strong>你的书，留在你的浏览器</strong>EPUB 与下载中的章节仅保存在本机，导入文件不会上传。书架与进度随账号同步；换设备需重新获取或导入书籍。清除网站数据会删除本机书籍，可先导出保存。</aside>
  <div class="fq-app" data-reading><p class="fq-muted">正在打开你的书架…</p></div>
</section>
<script>
  import { startReading } from '@/lib/replow/reading';
  if (document.readyState !== 'loading') startReading();
  else document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', startReading, { once: true });
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', startReading);
</script>
